## 🏆 Hackathon Objective

Our goal is to demonstrate how automated, evidence-based API security testing can help developers identify and fix cross-tenant authorization vulnerabilities before they reach production.

**TenantGuard — Test tenant boundaries. Detect data leaks. Verify the fix.**
